{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bee Streamer Idler is an overlay for streamers, meant to be used with OBS or StreamLabs Desktop! Use commands to enter and exit the hive and make honey!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021730/extras/f5d2be6f26a05ce44d39e02e51497d78.avif?t=1774814305\" width=866 height=404 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021730/extras/6018f8469634b45ea474fd791f2d349f.avif?t=1774814305\" width=860 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make more and more honey!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4021730/extras/b1d78da4e942a1a8110f5e75da0e3639.avif?t=1774814305\" width=860 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect pollen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Support the full release:</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to Youtube and Twitch, change layout, choose new skins, pick among many different flowers. Set the perfect mood for your stream! Decide on max number of chatters, who to spawn, and log in your bot account in the full version of Bee Streamer Idler! Wishlist now!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>List of commands:</strong></i>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!help (list of commands)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!exit\u00a0 (exit the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!enter (enter the beehive)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!flip (do a cool flip!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >!next (forward to the next honey combs)\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgroun